^task: root quota [0-9]+ MiB$
^hello: hi from a pod \([a-z0-9]+\); names: gift$
^(/[^ ]* )?\$ dock run hello$
^hello: hi from a pod \([a-z0-9]+\); names: console, store, fs, log, exec:[0-9]+$
^\[hello-1 exited with 0\]$
^hog: got [0-9]+ MiB, then QuotaExceeded$
^started h1 \(pod 2\)$
^ID  NAME      IMAGE     STATUS      MEMORY          TASKS$
^1   hello-1   hello     exited 0    0\.0/32\.0 MiB    0/8$
^2   h1        hog       running     [0-9.]+/4\.0 MiB +1/8$
^stopped h1$
^2   h1        hog       stopped     0\.0/4\.0 MiB     0/8$
^dock: no image nosuch$
